SUMMARY, WHICH IS NOT THE LICENCE

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including commercially,
provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate whether changes
were made.

REQUIRED ATTRIBUTION

Cite the publication identifier and version, and link to the permanent identifier route.
For example:

  NEO AI Research Program. "A Note on Responsible AI Capability Claims."
  NEO-AI-P-007 v1.0. Licensed CC BY 4.0.
  https://neoai.myneogroup.com/id/NEO-AI-P-007

WHAT THE LICENCE DOES NOT GRANT

The licence covers copyright in the text. It grants no trademark rights in NEO AI, LILI,
Mission Control, NEO TECH LABS or My NEO Group, and no patent licence.

A DERIVATIVE MUST NOT MISREPRESENT CAPABILITY STATUS

This is a request rather than a licence condition, and it is the one that matters most to
the Program. Every capability claim in this corpus carries a status token stating whether
the capability is operational, in pilot, validating, specified or planned. A derivative
that reproduces a claim while dropping its status token converts a statement of design
intent into a statement of deployment. Please carry the status with the claim.
